                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                            <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 block mb-0.5">Truthfulness & Authenticity Guarantee</span>
                            I confirm that the information submitted above is accurate and truthful, and that I am authorised to submit this event listing to K-Sync Malaysia. I understand that false, misleading or deceptive events will be rejected and may result in my submissions being blocked in future.
                        </div>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <!-- Main Action Buttons Ribbon (Preview Modal & Submit Buttons) -->
                <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
                    <a href="/organizer/dashboard" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-bold text-xs text-center transition-all">
                        Cancel
